Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Contour Lines Recede
- Story & Context: On a particularly restless night at the Sanctuary, Brother Silas scribbled down a recurring dream of a lost island called Aethel, its shores eroding into abstract contour lines, and the next morning, as he tried to recreate the feeling on his modular synth, an unprecedented feedback loop suddenly howled, summoning a flock of unseasonal albatrosses to circle the monastery with mournful cries, causing Sister Kaelen to wonder aloud, "Is the map tearing open or just folding in?"
